# Deer's copy for the error page's body title (design: the Electron error card's "Can't reach this
# page"). Firefox keeps the body titles of network errors in toolkit/neterror/certError.ftl
# (aboutNetError.mjs KNOWN_ERROR_TITLE_IDS); these ids override that file, every other id falls
# through to Firefox's. Certificate warnings and blocked pages keep Firefox's titles.

